" vimrc for Obsidian's Vim mode, read by the community plugin Vimrc Support (obsidian-vimrc-support).
" Source: dotfiles-windows/obsidian/vimrc. Its install.ps1 copies it to <vault>/.obsidian.vimrc and
" overwrites the copy, so edit the source. The plugin reads it once per Obsidian window: restart
" Obsidian after a change. Ctrl+h/j/k/l (move between splits) are hotkeys in obsidian/hotkeys.json.

" Shift+h / Shift+l: previous / next tab in the same tab group, like the buffers in LazyVim
exmap tabPrev obcommand workspace:previous-tab
exmap tabNext obcommand workspace:next-tab
nmap H :tabPrev<CR>
nmap L :tabNext<CR>
